# .cursorrules — profile

Cursor IDE rules. All workspace rules in `../../AGENTS.md`.

- Code style: 2-space TS, 4-space Python, single-quotes TS, double-quotes Python
- No `any`, no backup files, no `.env` writes
- All toolchain, routing, and conventions: see `../../AGENTS.md`
- Multi-file protocol (≥5 files): see `../../SOUL.md` canonical block
